{"id":"998fef6bee8f7a88","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-min-operator-generalized.md","title":"Minimization of Partial Functions","display":"df-min-operator-generalized — Minimization of Partial Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-min-operator-generalized","aliases":["57-df-min-operator-generalized"],"display":"df-min-operator-generalized — Minimization of Partial Functions","depends_on":["[[57-df-composition-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-min-operator-generalized"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-min-operator-generalized</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-operator-generalized — Minimization of Partial Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}\\)</span>；数值函数图及打包映射取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,j,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(y,j,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；不带下标的 MinGen 使用本次固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinGen}_{n}(g)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),0\\rangle\\in g\\land\n\\forall j&lt;y\\;\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j\\rangle),z\\rangle\\in g\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinGen}_{n}(g)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),0\\rangle\\in g\\land\n\\forall j&lt;y\\;\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j\\rangle),z\\rangle\\in g\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinGen}(g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinGen}_n(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinGen}(g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinGen}_n(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinGen}(g)\\in\\mathcal P_n,\\qquad\\mu^*g\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinGen}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinGen}(g)\\in\\mathcal P_n,\\qquad\\mu^*g\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinGen}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu^*g)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mu^*y\\,(g(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y)=0)\\coloneqq(\\mu^*g)(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu^*g)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mu^*y\\,(g(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y)=0)\\coloneqq(\\mu^*g)(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>较小输入若发散，后面的零值不能充当搜索结果；这不是仅从所有零值中取集合论最小元。原 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7\" href=\"?note=a27c6e4aaf7a32c7\" title=\"57-df-minimum-operator\">57-df-minimum-operator</a> 仍限于全函数输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}$；数值函数图及打包映射取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-minimum-operator","status":"resolved","id":"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"较小输入若发散，后面的零值不能充当搜索结果；这不是仅从所有零值中取集合论最小元。原 [[57-df-minimum-operator]] 仍限于全函数输入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"y,j,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinGen}_{n}(g)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),0\\rangle\\in g\\land\n\\forall j<y\\;\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j\\rangle),z\\rangle\\in g\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinGen}(g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinGen}_n(g).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinGen}(g)\\in\\mathcal P_n,\\qquad\\mu^*g\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MinGen}(g).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu^*g)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mu^*y\\,(g(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y)=0)\\coloneqq(\\mu^*g)(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1457,"backlinks":[{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。固定 [[57-df-program-numbering]] 的程序编号、[[57-df-t-predicate]] 的实际停机历史关系 $T_n$ 及 [[57-df-machine-coding]] 的总输出提取函数 $U$；不更换编号。$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，该编号的正规形和有效参数化性质取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。$\\varphi_e^{(n)}$ 为部分函数图，$\\varphi_e$ 默认为一元实例；多元调用使用同一打包映射。停机与部分值相等取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]。$\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 是下式的谓词见证搜索，只在存在历史时定义；不将广义部分函数搜索与普通集合最小元混淆，参见 [[57-df-minimum-operator]]、[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。"},{"id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\mathrm{PComp}$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{PPrimRec}$ 取 [[57-df-primrec-operator]]，$\\mathrm{MinGen}$ 取 [[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$r,n\\in\\mathbb N$；下述闭包按 $r$ 同时递归。每个算子的元数参数取该集合生成式中明示的元数，不从空部分函数图猜测。$\\chi_P:D_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是由下式定义的特征函数；$P\\subseteq D_n$。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-com